    "description": "<p>You unleash negative energy toward a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 7d8 + 30 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p>A Humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a <strong>Zombie</strong> (see appendix B) that follows your verbal orders.</p>",
